<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Mono Grid</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: #f0f0f0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
        #111111;
      background-size: 24px 24px;
      font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    }
    .panel {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 72px 24px;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 92px); margin: 0 0 20px; }
    p { color: #c9c9c9; max-width: 580px; line-height: 1.7; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="panel">
    <h1>Mono Grid</h1>
    <p>Operational layouts for route management, edge relay tuning and subscription delivery across compact private infrastructure.</p>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
